                "aurora_cluster_endpoint": "alex-aurora-cluster.cluster-c4xuyyo6q1bt.us-east-1.rds.amazonaws.com",
                "aurora_secret_arn": "arn:aws:secretsmanager:us-east-1:393470797331:secret:alex-aurora-credentials-e9e539bc-v98Ubw",
                "data_api_enabled": "Enabled",
                "database_name": "alex",
                "lambda_role_arn": "arn:aws:iam::393470797331:role/alex-lambda-aurora-role",
                "setup_instructions": "    \n✅ Aurora Serverless v2 cluster deployed successfully!\n    \nDatabase Details:\n- Cluster: alex-aurora-cluster\n- Database: alex\n- Data API: Enabled\n    \nAdd the following to your .env file:\nAURORA_CLUSTER_ARN=arn:aws:rds:us-east-1:393470797331:cluster:alex-aurora-cluster\nAURORA_SECRET_ARN=arn:aws:secretsmanager:us-east-1:393470797331:secret:alex-aurora-credentials-e9e539bc-v98Ubw\n    \nTest the Data API connection:\naws rds-data execute-statement \\\n  --resource-arn arn:aws:rds:us-east-1:393470797331:cluster:alex-aurora-cluster \\\n  --secret-arn arn:aws:secretsmanager:us-east-1:393470797331:secret:alex-aurora-credentials-e9e539bc-v98Ubw \\\n  --database alex \\\n  --sql \"SELECT version()\"\n    \nTo set up the database schema:\ncd backend/database\nuv run migrate.py\n    \nTo load sample data:\nuv run reset_db.py --with-test-data\n    \n💰 Cost Management:\n- Current scaling: 0.5 - 1 ACUs\n- Estimated cost: ~$43/month minimum\n- To pause: Set min_capacity to 0 (cluster will pause after 5 minutes of inactivity)\n"
              },
              "type": [
